.TH "intel_infoframes" "1" "2016-03-01" "igt-gpu-tools 2.5" "General Commands Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
intel_infoframes \- View and change HDMI InfoFrames
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBintel_infoframes\fP [\fIOPTIONS\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBintel_infoframes\fP is a tool to view and change the HDMI InfoFrames sent by
the GPU. Its main purpose is to be used as a debugging tool. In some cases
(e.g., when changing modes) the Kernel will undo the changes made by this tool.
.sp
Descriptions of the InfoFrame fields can be found on the HDMI and CEA\-861
specifications.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B  \-h\fP,\fB  \-\-help
Display comprehensive help on the tool.
.UNINDENT
.SH LIMITATIONS
.sp
Not all HDMI monitors respect the InfoFrames sent to them. Only GEN 4 or newer
hardware is supported yet.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report bugs on fd.o GitLab: \%<https://\:gitlab\:.freedesktop\:.org/\:drm/\:igt-gpu-tools/\:-/\:issues>
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
HDMI specification, CEA\-861 specification.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
IGT Developers <igt-dev@lists.freedesktop.org>
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
2012,2016 Intel Corporation
